            "review_text": "JJChow604\nVancouver, Canada39 contributions\n0\nI hope you know Vietnamese\nAug 2016 • Couples\nThis is a tough one to review. Yes they cater very much to locals. Their price point is better than the tourist areas and the food is pretty good. However the language barrier is tough to get over. The servers speak very VERY little English. The menu is all in Vietnamese. It's challenging to order what you want or even get the servers to help unless you know some Vietnamese.\nRead more\nWritten August 6, 2016",
